comments_content:
Bouncer on Android.

It's an app that gives you the ability to grant permissions temporarily.&nbsp;
Quoting them directly from their play store description :

"Want to tag a location or take a photo, but don't want that app to be able to use the camera or get your location whenever it wants? Bouncer gives you exactly that. As soon as you exit the app, Bouncer will automatically remove the permission for you in an instant so you can get back to doing what you do best, without having to worry about apps invading your privacy and wasting your battery. "&nbsp;&nbsp;

Lookup&nbsp; -&nbsp;&nbsp;
Allows you to quickly look words (in a popup) while reading anything.&nbsp;
https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=gaurav.lookup&amp;hl=en_IN

(I am the creator of the app)
